  "description": "Provides authentication and authorization components for the KUKULCAN architecture, including local authentication, federated credential validation, multi-tenant identity management, user and tenant membership handling, and authentication infrastructure.\n            Designed to provide consistent, reusable, and secure authentication capabilities across KUKULCAN applications and services.",
